<title>CANADA: Canada April new motor vehicle sales fall 4.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada April new motor vehicle sales fall 4.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>New motor vehicle sales fell 4.9 percent seasonally adjusted in April to 112,723 units from from a revised 118,582 (121,715) units in March, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A Reuters survey of economists had forecast an average 5.8 percent fall in March vehicle sales.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
</text>
